⚙️ Feature Engineering

Used TF-IDF (Term Frequency–Inverse Document Frequency) Vectorization to transform text reviews into numerical feature vectors.

Benefits

✅ Captures important keywords

✅ Reduces noise from common words

✅ Improves classification performance

✅ Suitable for high-dimensional text data

🤖 Machine Learning Models Implemented
1️⃣ Logistic Regression
Fast and efficient
Excellent baseline model for text classification
Strong generalization capability
2️⃣ Multinomial Naive Bayes
Designed specifically for text classification
Performs well with TF-IDF features
Computationally efficient
3️⃣ Random Forest Classifier
Ensemble learning approach
Captures complex patterns in data
Reduces overfitting
